  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/574642/diamond-spheres-erudition-esoterica\">Diamond Spheres: Erudition &amp; Esoterica</a></sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites</strong>: Destruction sphere (Energy Beam (blast shape), Sculpt Blast (blast shape)), caster level 5th.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit</strong>: Whenever you create or maintain an Energy Beam, you can choose to have the line become a 10-foot cone, + 5 feet per 2 caster levels.</p>\n<p><strong>Special</strong>: If you possess the Calamity advanced talent, you can augment your Energy Beam as if it were the Sculpt Blast blast shape.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/general-feats#toc25\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
